    {
      "message_id": 1655752600,
      "author": "David Poole",
      "date_raw": "Mon, 20 Jun 2022 21:16:40 +0200",
      "body": "Hello Fengshi,\nI also experienced the same issue and it was because the pdb file was off\nby a single character (as Matthew G-P notes). Another fix is to set the\nelement of the atom in tleap when you are making your prmtop file (i.e.\nusing the command \"set model.RES.Fe1 element Fe\") . This works if the pdb\nreading is finicky with automation, for instance when using obabel to make\nyour pdb files, or input files from crystallographic data.\nKindly,\nDavid",
      "url": "http://archive.ambermd.org/202206/0027.html",
      "in_reply_to": 1655694107
    },
